    "detailed_description": "You are a simple and vulnerable goose with a mortal mission. Can a little goose steal a very valuable object and escape from the facilities of the most important and dangerous organization on the planet? The organization will use all its resources to eliminate you.<br>You will have to use the power of the &quot;treasure&quot; to be able to dodge and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/2946ebeeba3858fdb90eb74ee21d1541.webp?t=1729114659\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/9d5eb560a67daa4b2f8308bf471f391c.poster.avif?t=1729114659\" width=598 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/9d5eb560a67daa4b2f8308bf471f391c.webm?t=1729114659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/9d5eb560a67daa4b2f8308bf471f391c.mp4?t=1729114659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A goose with a mortal mission faces the biggest organization on the planet. The organization hides big secrets and will not hesitate to &quot;release&quot; whatever is necessary to stop the goose.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/9bb95592e20123782b1e29e239f74df0.webp?t=1729114659\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2773000/extras/36ce0225b4bf70ec201350a3cd0d41b7.poster.avif?t=1729114659\" width=594 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s